{"id":176,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と自立を育む奈良教大附属中","feature_description":"奈良教育大学附属中学校は、自ら考え行動し、共に学び合い、高め合う生徒の育成を掲げる附属中です。学校生活では運動・文化合わせて12のサークル活動が火曜を除いて継続的に行われ、学びと自治、協働の両面を大切にする方針が公式サイトで確認できました。 奈良教育大学との連携や附属校としての役割も踏まえ、学習内容と生活指導の両面で自立を促す設計が読み取れます。","clubs":[{"id":3320,"name":"女子バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3321,"name":"男子バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3322,"name":"男子ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3323,"name":"女子ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3324,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3325,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3326,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3327,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3328,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3329,"name":"裏山クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3330,"name":"料理・手芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3331,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nara-edu.ac.jp/JHS/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3332,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部",